{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7edb42d1-d543-8182-a2ff-24171c5cd3a6",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T11:28:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dario Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:26:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Sandra. Hello, and thank you very much for answering. I hope your day is going well. My name is Dario Varela."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, thank you, Mr. Varela, it's going fine so far. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, so, I am calling with a small problem, but it is not so small for me anymore. There is a dog next door. It barks, and it barks, and it does not stop. Since Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:26:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, since Monday. That's three days now. Is it barking all day, or at certain times?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:26:51-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All day, and also in the night. The owner leaves in the morning and the dog is alone, I think. I am working from home, so I hear everything. I have been patient, believe me. I did not want to call. But now it is every day again and I cannot concentrate, I cannot sleep properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:27:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that wears on you fast. Do you want to make a report on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:27:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, I would like a report to be taken. That is exactly what I want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:27:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address where the dog is, or where you're hearing it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:27:26-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am at 404 Chapel Street. The dog is in the apartment next to mine, through the wall. Right now, as we speak, you can maybe hear it. [pause] Sorry, the neighbors are also painting, I think. There is a smell of fresh paint in the next room, very strong, so maybe somebody is there today. But the dog, still it barks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:27:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't hear it through the phone, but I believe you. So that's 404 Chapel Street, and you're in the unit next to the one with the dog?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:27:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly, exactly. Thank you for understanding."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me get your name spelled right. V-A-R-E-L-A?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:28:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Dario Varela. And my number is 401-555-0194, if someone needs to call me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:28:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0194. I'll put this down as a barking complaint, since Monday, at 404 Chapel Street, and it'll go to the people who handle animal and noise issues. They'll follow up with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:28:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Sandra. I hope it will be soon. Every day it is the same, and I am tired of it, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:28:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. If it keeps up tonight, call back and we'll add it to the report. You take care, Mr. Varela."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:28:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. God bless you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
